lFU0j8rxajGeQ6JmeJiDbZRR6tqsYA&oe=6B05BFE7"}, "display_name": "stay\u2022safe CAPD - VR Demo USA", "keywords": ["staysafe", "fresenius", "dialysis", "peritoneal", "capd"], "long_description": "This app is for United States only. \n\nThe stay\u2022safe\u00ae CAPD - Virtual Reality Demo is a digital learning tool that offers support to clinics and nephrologists in creating awareness of the Continuous Ambulatory Peritoneal Dialysis (CAPD) therapy. \n\nIncluding:\n\n- Virtual step-by-step demonstration of a stay\u2022safe\u00ae CAPD exchange.\n- An immersive 3D environment that supports learning by doing.\n- Support for different learning styles with a mix of visual, auditory, and interactive elements.\n\nLearning mode: Offers step-by-step guidance from preparation to set-up, connection and finally, disconnection.\n\nThe stay\u2022safe CAPD VR cannot replace hands-on patient training by a trained professional, and it is not intended to do so.\n\nDisclaimer: stay\u2022safe CAPD US VR and the VR glasses are not medical devices. They were created to support education on CAPD therapy with the use of the stay\u2022safe system. \n", "short_description": "This app is for United States only. \n\nThe stay\u2022safe\u00ae CAPD - Virtual Reality Demo USA is a digital learning tool that offers support to clinics and nephrologists in creating awareness of the CAPD therapy. \n\nIncluding:\n- Virtual step-by-step demonstration of a stay\u2022safe\u00ae CAPD exchange \n- An immersive 3D environment that supports learning by doing\n- Support for different learning styles with a mix of visual, auditory, and interactive elements"}]}, "developer_name": "Fresenius USA Marketing", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://freseniusmedicalcare.com/en-us/privacy-statement/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://freseniusmedicalcare.com/content/dam/fmcna/live/support/documents/techical-documentation/staysafe/stay%E2%80%A2safe%20CAPD%20-%20VR%20Demo%20USA%20-%20Terms%20of%20use.pdf", "publi